WEBVTT

00:02:29.421 --> 00:02:34.345
with a lot of very high quality 
education provider partnership,

00:02:34.604 --> 00:02:37.495
mainly from the US but from Europe,

00:02:37.495 --> 00:02:42.016
and trying to really be 
very highly selective in the program

00:02:42.016 --> 00:02:44.535
that it is really related 
to the needs of the region,

00:02:44.535 --> 00:02:47.490
but at the same time 
on a very high quality,

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:50.934
where the quality, 
or maintaining the quality

00:02:50.934 --> 00:02:52.354
of the different program

00:02:52.354 --> 00:02:55.034
is not only the responsibility 
of the Foundation,

00:02:55.034 --> 00:02:57.714
but it's also part 
of the responsibility of the partner.

00:02:57.714 --> 00:03:01.489
To be able to do so, 
Education City was created